WEBVTT

00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:16,620
I think you have alluded to bone broth before, but is that okay for cancer patients?

00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:25,660
So bone broth is typically used to help heal the gut. Why does bone broth work to heal the gut?

00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:31,980
What's that? Is there something magic in bone broth? No, what's in bone broth? You know, when you take

00:00:32,780 --> 00:00:39,900
beef bones or chicken bones, you put them in water and you cook them for three days.

00:00:41,180 --> 00:00:47,900
You're basically drawing a lot of nutrients out of the bone. When you're done making bone broth,

00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:55,020
you could basically eat the bone because it's just soft. Typically, when you're trying to

00:00:55,020 --> 00:01:00,940
heal the gut, you can eat the bones except maybe a big beef bone, but definitely chicken bone

00:01:00,940 --> 00:01:04,700
when you make chicken bone broth, you could eat the bones and it would be good for you.

00:01:07,260 --> 00:01:15,820
But the reason why bone broth is so good to help heal leaky gut is because you're

00:01:15,820 --> 00:01:24,940
drawing so much glutamate out of the bones. So the amount of glutamate in bone broth is super high.

00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:30,860
That's why it's so good to help heal the gut because glutamate helps cell turnover,

00:01:31,580 --> 00:01:36,380
helps cells reproduce, really stimulates reproduction of epithelial cells.

00:01:37,900 --> 00:01:43,820
And that's the lining of the gutter epithelial cells. Well, if you have cancer, you don't want to

00:01:43,820 --> 00:01:53,020
be turning on growth factors for epithelial cells. So I wouldn't use bone broth for a person that

00:01:53,020 --> 00:01:58,700
has cancer. Well, let's say my cancer is in remission, I'm doing really well. Could you use

00:01:58,700 --> 00:02:04,380
bone broth for a short period of time to help heal the gut? Yes, I would say yes, you can.

00:02:05,580 --> 00:02:13,100
But for a short period of time, maybe a week, and then go back to other things. There's a lot of

00:02:13,100 --> 00:02:20,140
other things other than elglutamine that you could use to help heal the gut. So it's not like your

00:02:20,140 --> 00:02:27,020
gut's not going to heal if you don't take elglutamine or bone broth with high concentrations about

00:02:27,020 --> 00:02:36,060
glutamates. It's not necessary. So I would tend to just stay away from it.

